          "RotWord: combinational cyclic left shift of a 32-bit word.",
          "SubWord: four parallel S-box lookups on each byte of the rotated word, combinational.",
          "RconXOR: XOR of SubWord result with the round constant from aes_rcon, combinational."
        ],
